.TH PROFILE-FORMAT 1 "2026-11-05" "pv-suite 0.4.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
profile-format \- rewrite pv-suite device profiles into the canonical layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B profile-format.py
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rewrites the given pv-suite device-profile JSON files in place into the
canonical layout (the \fBsun2000.json\fR shape): the description first,
then the acl tree, then the mappings, then the registers \(em one
mappings entry per line, one register per line, the keys in the family
order. Content-preserving and idempotent: a profile already in shape
comes back byte-for-byte unchanged.
.PP
Validate before/after with
.BR profile-lint (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
every file reformatted (or reported already in shape).
.TP
.B 1
an invalid JSON file (it is left untouched).
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
.B profile-format.py profiles/profiles/deye-sg03lp1.json
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR profile-lint (1)
.PP
\fBprofiles/README.md\fR in the suite checkout \(em the profile format.
